               *      Set HW flush linkdown port mac configuration of the specified device.
               * Input:
               *      port - Port id.
               *      enable - link down flush status
               * Output:
               *      None
               * Return:
               *      RT_ERR_OK           - OK
               *      RT_ERR_FAILED       - Failed
               *      RT_ERR_SMI          - SMI access error
               *      RT_ERR_PORT_ID      - Invalid port number.
